Irregular triangle read by rows: T(n,m) = number of permutations of {1, 2, ..., n} which form arithmetic progressions modulo m (n>=1, 1<=m<=n+2).

The 63 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A261902

